    {
      "id": "claim_526400a17e2b43e3acc37c76ded9f861",
      "statement": "GizmosExtensions exists because Unity's gizmo lines have no thickness: it routes through Handles.DrawBezier with a degenerate control polygon and scales thickness by camera distance so gizmos do not turn into slabs up close; the whole file including its namespace is wrapped in a UNITY_EDITOR guard.",
